    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i hear that \"market correction\" thing, but it feels like a lot of these \"compliance rules\" are just unnecessary red tape that keeps small players out so the big corporations can keep their monopoly. don't you think cutting back on some of those regulations would basically clear the path for much more actual innovation?",
